ry to seize that  common ground  and um make the case that we can work  together  on these kinds of uh statues i'm willing  to hear  from um any of the witnesses who want to  make any sort of final  remarks or senator cruz if if he has  anything  mr horowitz i just want to thank  everybody from the committee for mr  chairman for the ranking member for  giving this a fair  undertaking and i i really believe that  we can reach  an agreement here i think it's important  to save lives i think we can protect due  process we can protect constitutional  lights and save lives and for everybody  on this panel  i think we want to come together and  that's what we want to do is save lives  and i hope  the members of this committee can hear  what we've taken today  craft something that really works and um  and save lives so thank you for this  time i'm  deeply appreciative of being here today  and for this very serious consideration  thank you  thank you to all the uh witnesses thanks  to senator cruz  uh and all the colleagues who appeared  here the record will remain open for one  week  and anyone with questions can submit  you


